focus on that right now. okay?

287
00:25:19.794 --> 00:25:20.898
This is my night.

288
00:25:22.590 --> 00:25:24.937
You're right. Fuck yeah. it is.

289
00:25:25.731 --> 00:25:28.250
And you know what?
You've worked so hard.

290
