Annual Academy Awards.</i>

328
00:28:02.301 --> 00:28:03.301
What's wrong?

329
00:28:04.855 --> 00:28:06.374
I think I just
had a contraction.

330
00:28:07.133 --> 00:28:09.411
Okay. Just hold
tight. Good evening.

331
00:28:10.136 --> 00:28:11.966
I want to take the
time to congratulate

332
